C R7 OL GOV-009,GOV-003 | MUST (PostToolUse message) | A SPECIFICATION.md change triggers the instruction to confirm it stays consistent with CUSTOM_SETTINGS.md and records only approved behavior. | SPECIFICATION.md changes | none stated
C R8 OL ARC-020,GOV-017 | MUST (PostToolUse message) | Removing a project file is reported as a project-graph change to confirm as intended and approved (CLAUDE.md Decisions; project-structure). | .csproj removal | none stated
C R9 OL WF-005,GOV-014 | MUST (PostToolUse message) | A moved manifest/project is reported so that every reference to it is updated (project-structure). | Moved .csproj / package manifests | none stated
